The files in this directory, and the sm_80 kernel paths in the surrounding Inkling2 files that call them
(attention, local-window and FlashInfer-hybrid prefill, conv/mix, loop controller, GEMV, Humming tiles and
fused SiTU epilogue, MoE routing), are ported from

  snailbrainx/inkling-2-mini-sm80 (https://github.com/snailbrainx/inkling-2-mini-sm80), commit 8b998e0a2f,
  Apache License 2.0.

Changes here: the CUDA extension is JIT-compiled by inkling_sm80_cuda.py instead of prebuilt; the Humming
header is put on Humming's include path by humming_epilogue.py instead of sitecustomize; their kernels are
merged with the HyperInkling SM8x path (INT4 drafter, INT8 attention / LM head, E4M3 KV with bf16 staging for
the local-window and FlashInfer-hybrid prefill kernels). humming_include/ holds a modified Humming header
(Apache-2.0, copyright the Humming contributors).
